\newlabel{fig:roofline}{{3}{5}{Roofline-style throughput curve for our CPU configuration. The 5-point stencil's AI~$\approx $~0.5--0.75 puts us where the red arrow lands. On the bandwidth-bound diagonal, well below the peak- compute plateau. This is real measured data, not the canonical double-roof cartoon: the curve is what we observe as we vary the working-set size and AI together.\relax }{figure.caption.10}{}}
